  "セラ「光だけでは守れない場所を、れいが教えてくれました。」": "Sera \"Rei showed me the places that cannot be protected by light alone.\"",
  "セラ「怖くても読みます。れいが一人でページを閉じないように。」": "Sera \"I'll read even if I'm scared. Don't let Rei close the page alone.\"",
  "セラ「恋人として、あなたのいる場所へ何度でも帰ります」": "Sera “As my lover, I will return to the place where you are as many times as I want.”",
  "セラ「星界の辞書に、ひよりの花言葉を増やしておきました。」": "Sera \"I added the flower language of Hiyori to the dictionary of the star world.\"",
  "セラ「案内板を作ります。こはる監修なら、風向き表示つきです。」": "Sera \"I will make a guide board. If supervised by Koharu, it will include a wind direction display.\"",
  "セラ「次に会う日も、光の記録へ大切に残します」": "Sera “Even the next time we meet, I will cherish it in the record of light.”",
