  "好感度 90": "Affection 90",
  "完璧な予定表には、理玖が勝手に書き足した余白が残った。それを消さないことが颯真の信頼だった。": "In the perfect schedule, there was a blank space that Riku added without permission. It was Soma's trust not to erase that.",
  "封印門の前で、二人は違う祈りを同じ未来へ重ねた。光と闇は対立ではなく、世界を守る両翼になった。": "In front of the sealed gate, the two prayed different prayers for the same future. Light and darkness are no longer in conflict, but have become two wings that protect the world.",
  "幕が下りても、二人の挑戦は続く。観客の拍手より先に、互いの「大丈夫」が聞こえるから。": "Even after the curtain falls, the challenges of these two continue. Because you can hear each other's \"Okay\" before the audience's applause.",
  "御影 颯真": "Soma Mikage",
  "御影 颯真「待ってくれ。この状況を同時処理する規則はない……私が逃げないうちに、順番に話してほしい。」": "Soma Mikage \"Wait. There are no rules for handling this situation simultaneously...I want you to take turns talking before I run away.\"",
  "御影 颯真とエリオット・ノクス、譲れない告白": "Soma Mikage and Elliot Nox: A Confession Neither Will Yield",
