  "恋愛エンド": "Romance Ending",
  "戦いを終えた学園で、彼は自分の言葉で彼女を次の約束へ誘った。二人の関係は穏やかな未来へ続いていく。": "At the school after the battle, he invited her to his next appointment with his own words. The relationship between the two continues into a peaceful future.",
  "拍手がなくても、二人なら幕を上げられる。互いの無茶を楽しめる最高の共演者だった。": "Even without applause, two people can raise the curtain. They were the perfect co-stars who could enjoy each other's recklessness.",
  "星宮あかり": "Akari Hoshimiya",
  "星宮あかり「わ、わかったから二人とも一歩だけ下がって！星より先に私の心臓が爆発しちゃうよ！」": "Akari Hoshimiya: \"Okay, so you two just take a step back! My heart will explode before the stars!\"",
