  "星月同盟エンド": "star moon alliance end",
  "星界の記録に、ひよりの花の名前が増えていく。セラにとってこの世界は、もう任務先ではなく友達のいる場所だった。": "The names of Hiyori flowers are increasing in the records of the star world. For Sera, this world was no longer a place of mission, but a place where he had friends.",
  "朔夜「それで十分だ。次に迷う時は、その炎を目印にする。」": "Sakuya \"That's enough. Next time I'm lost, I'll use that flame as a guide.\"",
  "朔夜「だが君と過ごすこの日常を守るためなら、何度でも未来を選び直そう」": "Sakuya: “But in order to protect this everyday life I spend with you, I will choose my future again and again.”",
  "朔夜「今度は戦いのない日に、ゆっくり続きを話そう」": "Sakuya: “Next time, let’s talk about the rest slowly on a day when there is no battle.”",
  "朔夜「君と過ごす平穏を、もう失いたくはない」": "Sakuya \"I don't want to lose the peace I have with you\"",
  "朔夜「急がなくていい。これからも君の一番近くで、答えを探したい」": "Sakuya \"There's no need to rush. I want to continue searching for answers by being closest to you.\"",
  "朔夜「恋人として君を守る。過去ではなく、私が選んだ未来として」": "Sakuya \"I'll protect you as my lover. Not the past, but the future I chose.\"",
  "朔夜「次の約束を私から求めるとは、以前なら考えられなかった」": "Sakuya \"Before, I would never have thought of asking for another promise from me.\"",
  "朔夜「私の生涯を、君と幸福になるために使うと誓う」": "Sakuya \"I promise to spend my life being happy with you.\"",
  "朔夜「私の過去を知れば軽蔑するだろう。それでも聞くというのか」": "Sakuya \"If they knew about my past, they would look down on me. Are you still going to listen to me?\"",
  "朔夜「穏やかな日々も戦いも、この手を離さず共に越えよう」": "Sakuya \"Whether it's calm days or battles, let's hold hands and overcome it together.\"",
  "朔夜「穏やかな朝には、まだ慣れない」": "Sakuya “I still can’t get used to the calm mornings.”",
  "朔夜「答えが出るまで、君の隣を守ることを許してほしい」": "Sakuya \"Please allow me to protect your side until I get an answer.\"",
  "朔夜「組織には戻らない。君を傷つける命令に従うくらいなら、すべてを敵に回す」": "Sakuya \"I will not return to the organization. I would rather make everyone my enemy than follow orders that would harm you.\"",
  "朔夜「赦しではなく、私自身を見てくれる君が特別なのだ」": "Sakuya \"You're special because you see me for myself, not for forgiveness.\"",
  "朔夜「赦しはいらないと言ったのに、君は隣に残った。」": "Sakuya \"Even though I said I didn't need forgiveness, you remained next to me.\"",
  "朔夜「運命の封印も世界の敵意も、君への道だけは閉ざせない」": "Sakuya \"Neither the seal of fate nor the hostility of the world can close the road to you.\"",
  "朔夜「過去へ沈みかけた時、君の声はひどく現実的だった。」": "Sakuya \"As I sank into the past, your voice sounded so real.\"",
  "朝霧 蓮": "Ren Asagiri",
  "朝霧 蓮「ちょっと待て、二人とも近い。ちゃんと向き合うから、まず落ち着いて一人ずつ話してくれ。」": "Ren Asagiri \"Wait a minute, you two are close. I'll face you properly, so please calm down and talk to me one by one first.\"",
