  "特別な関係エンド": "special relationship ending",
  "理玖「この時間だけ観測をやめようか。結果を知らずに君と歩いてみたい」": "Riku \"Let's stop observing for just this time. I want to walk with you without knowing the results.\"",
  "理玖「どの未来でも君を探してしまう。それなら答えは十分だよね」": "Riku \"I'll be looking for you in every future. That's enough of an answer.\"",
  "理玖「予想外の返事を、また隣で聞かせてよ」": "Riku “Let me hear your unexpected answer next to you again.”",
  "理玖「今度は戦いのない日に、ゆっくり続きを話そう」": "Riku: “Next time, let’s talk about the rest slowly on a day when there is no battle.”",
  "理玖「今日の未来予報は見ていないよ」": "Riku “I haven’t looked at today’s future forecast.”",
  "理玖「君が何を選ぶか、隣で驚く方がずっと楽しいからね」": "Riku \"It's much more fun to be surprised by what you choose next to me.\"",
  "理玖「君が驚く明日を、これからも一番近くで楽しみたい」": "Riku “I want to continue to enjoy the tomorrow that will surprise you as close as I can.”",
  "理玖「急がなくていい。これからも君の一番近くで、答えを探したい」": "Riku \"There's no need to rush. I want to continue searching for answers by being closest to you.\"",
  "理玖「恋人になった未来は見ていない。今ここで、僕が選んだから」": "Riku \"I don't see a future where we become lovers. It's my choice here and now.\"",
  "理玖「未来は読みにくい方が面白いだろ。ほら、余白は残したよ。」": "Riku \"The future is more interesting if it's hard to read. Look, I left some blank space.\"",
  "理玖「未来を一つに決めないって、意外と規則的だろ？」": "Riku \"Not deciding on one future is surprisingly regular, isn't it?\"",
  "理玖「次のアドリブ、未来で見ても意味不明だったよ。」": "Riku: “The next ad-lib made no sense even if I watched it in the future.”",
  "理玖「次の予定は観測していない。君を誘う瞬間くらい、自分で選びたいから」": "Riku \"I haven't observed my next schedule. I want to choose the moment I invite you out myself.\"",
  "理玖「正解の未来なんてない。僕が選ぶのは、君が生きて笑う今だ」": "Riku \"There is no correct future. What I choose is the present, where you live and laugh.\"",
  "理玖「無数の分岐があっても、僕は毎回君の手を取る」": "Riku “Even if there are countless branches, I will take your hand every time.”",
  "理玖「結末を先に見ず、二人で一日ずつ確かめよう」": "Riku \"Don't look at the ending first, let's check each day together\"",
  "理玖「聞こえたよ。問題は、君がさらに派手にして歴史を変えることだ。」": "Riku: \"I heard you. The problem is that you're going to make it even more flashy and change history.\"",
  "理玖「運命じゃない。何度でも選び直すことを、永遠と呼ぼう」": "Riku \"It's not fate. Let's call it eternity, choosing again and again.\"",
