  "神代 レオンと黒羽れいの、その先": "Leon Kamishiro and Rei Kurobane: What Comes Next",
  "秘密は孤独に抱えるものではない。二人は守るべき記録と、頼れる友を同時に得た。": "Secrets are not meant to be kept in solitude. The two gained a record to protect and a friend they could rely on.",
  "精霊樹の枝には、星界へ続く小さな光が宿った。二人が守る場所は、もう一つの世界にも届いている。": "In the branches of the Spirit Tree, there was a small light that continued to the Astral World. The place they protect has reached another world.",
  "紫藤みらい": "Mirai Shido",
  "紫藤みらい「待って、こんな急展開は台本にないわ……！でも逃げないから、一人ずつ私に言葉をちょうだい。」": "Mirai Shido \"Wait, this sudden development wasn't in the script...! But I won't run away, so give me your words one by one.\"",
  "紫藤みらいとエリオット・ノクスの、その先": "Mirai Shido and Elliot Nox: What Comes Next",
