  "翠川まどか": "Madoka Midorikawa",
  "翠川まどか「ひゃっ、二人同時は処理が追いつきません……！ログを分けるので、順番にお願いします。」": "Madoka Midorikawa \"Hey, I can't keep up with the processing if two people are working at the same time...! I'll separate the logs, so please take turns.\"",
  "翠川まどかとエリオット・ノクスの、その先": "Madoka Midorikawa and Elliot Nox: What Comes Next",
