  "黒羽れい": "Rei Kurobane",
  "黒羽れい「待て。二人に迫られては、さすがの私も判断が乱れる……一人ずつ、言葉を聞かせろ。」": "Rei Kurobane: \"Wait. If I were to be pressured by two people, even I would have trouble making decisions...let each one speak their words.\"",
